{"uid":"24d7b51ae2be67a4","name":"test_a_runner_that_returns_no_result_is_a_recorded_failure_not_an_attributeerror","fullName":"tests.test_iteration_cancellation_contained#test_a_runner_that_returns_no_result_is_a_recorded_failure_not_an_attributeerror","historyId":"154c636701e1293c812813a08f3a58f1","time":{"start":1791942017312,"stop":1791942017320,"duration":8},"description":"Task 091, second half: the `None` result must be survivable at the\n    BOUNDARY, not merely inside `_classify_result`.\n\n    `_classify_result` was only the FIRST of a dozen `result.` reads on the\n    recording path (`self._last_fault_error = result.error_message or \"\"`,\n    meta.update's exit-code/interrupt/timeout fields, the `iteration.end`\n    emit, the usage accounting), so guarding that one method alone left the\n    same `AttributeError: 'NoneType' object has no attribute 'error_message'`\n    one line further down -- and an AttributeError raised there REPLACES\n    whatever the iteration was really doing, which is exactly the containment\n    failure this module exists to forbid.\n\n    A runner that returns `None` instead of an IterationResult is the\n    reachable producer of that shape: it raises nothing, so no `except` above\n    the recording path can see it. It must land as one ordinary recorded\n    failed iteration, and the run must stay alive.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Task 091, second half: the <code>None</code> result must be survivable at the<br />\nBOUNDARY, not merely inside <code>_classify_result</code>.</p>\n<pre><code>`_classify_result` was only the FIRST of a dozen `result.` reads on the\nrecording path (`self._last_fault_error = result.error_message or &quot;&quot;`,\nmeta.update's exit-code/interrupt/timeout fields, the `iteration.end`\nemit, the usage accounting), so guarding that one method alone left the\nsame `AttributeError: 'NoneType' object has no attribute 'error_message'`\none line further down -- and an AttributeError raised there REPLACES\nwhatever the iteration was really doing, which is exactly the containment\nfailure this module exists to forbid.\n\nA runner that returns `None` instead of an IterationResult is the\nreachable producer of that shape: it raises nothing, so no `except` above\nthe recording path can see it. It must land as one ordinary recorded\nfailed iteration, and the run must stay alive.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791941650409,"stop":1791941650410,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791941650410,"stop":1791941650410,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_asyncio_loop_factory","time":{"start":1791941815736,"stop":1791941815736,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791942017291,"stop":1791942017297,"duration":6},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791942017291,"stop":1791942017291,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791942017297,"stop":1791942017298,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],